  "repo": "swesmith/bottlepy__bottle.a8dfef30",
  "problem_statement": "ConfigDict overlay iteration broken - yields None values instead of valid overlays\n\n#### Description\n\nThe `_iter_overlays` method in ConfigDict is yielding None values instead of valid overlay objects, breaking overlay functionality.\n\n#### Steps/Code to Reproduce\n\n```python\nfrom bottle import ConfigDict\n\n# Create a source config and overlays\nsource = ConfigDict()\nsource['key'] = 'source'\nintermediate = source._make_overlay()\noverlay = intermediate._make_overlay()\n\n# This should work but fails\nprint(overlay['key'])  # Expected: 'source', but raises KeyError or returns wrong value\n```\n\nThe issue appears when trying to access values through overlay chains. The overlay mechanism should allow child overlays to inherit values from parent configurations, but the iteration over overlays is not working correctly.",
